  preserves mission intent, effect class, spec and graph bytes, candidate plan identity and receipt-chain evidence
  drops Python subprocess compilation and opt-in-only compiler wiring
  forbidden_inference verified compilation -> canary pass or active mission
  binding integrations/mcp/v6_server.mjs
  binding integrations/mcp/v6_hypervisor_bridge.mjs
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/v6_transport.test.mjs

